              "text": "राक्षस — rākṣas — \"an ogre; a demon\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गोष्टीतल्या राक्षसाला सात डोकी होती. goṣṭītalyā rākṣasālā sāt ḍokī hotī. The ogre in the story had seven heads."
